{"id":11344,"date":"2024-05-05T10:25:35","date_gmt":"2024-05-05T17:25:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/?post_type=lesson&#038;p=11344"},"modified":"2024-06-04T10:49:41","modified_gmt":"2024-06-04T17:49:41","slug":"0-1-introduction-to-zumi","status":"publish","type":"lesson","link":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/0-1-introduction-to-zumi\/","title":{"rendered":"0.1: Introduction to Zumi"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2214c047f4a\" name=\"6a2214c047f4a\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 1<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Introduction to AI with Zumi<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Let&#8217;s get to know a little bit more about Zumi. In this video, you will get an introduction to Zumi and the features.[\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=&#8221;https:\/\/youtu.be\/z09vnNFsP-U&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2214c0480a7\" name=\"6a2214c0480a7\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 2<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Unboxing Zumi<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]If you haven&#8217;t already, open up your Zumi box to see what&#8217;s inside! You should have all of the components seen here in this image. All of the tools you need to build and learn with Zumi are included in the kit. Take inventory of all of the parts before continuing to the important maintenance and care video in the next step.[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;11491&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2214c048101\" name=\"6a2214c048101\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 3<\/span><\/div>\